      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2013 Elsevier Ltd. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Searching for novel antiobesity agents, a series of cannabinoid LH21 and of Rimonabant-fatty acid amide analogues have been prepared. Synthesis of pyrazoles 2a-2c was achieved by a two steps simple methodology via α,β-unsaturated ketones. Carboxamides 8a-8h were obtained in good yields from esters 7a-7c by a one-pot procedure which takes place under mild conditions. New compounds have been evaluated in vivo as anorectic agents. Some of them showed interesting properties reducing food intake in rats by a mechanism which does not involve the endocannabinoid system."
      },
